{"agent":"U13","data":{"fix_task":"fix-B21968d4ea4","item":"","scope":"ddflow","severity":"high","summary":"doctor exits 1 and brief shows a false 'Lost events' block: shardmarks._rows_here selects every mark row whose ref equals the current branch regardless of key, and lost() takes the shard name from row['shard']. Four rows written by the intermediate build (plain shard-name key, ref field, NO shard field) therefore get name '' (not on disk, scanned as 0 events) and report 'lost N event(s) (was N, now 0)' with an empty shard name. Not a git-vs-working-tree issue: lost() scans the working tree. accept cannot clear them either (it pops the key for shard ''). Fix: migrate legacy plain keys to scoped rows on read (max count, never lowering), derive shard/ref from the key, replace torn shapes; uncommitted appends are never a loss.","title":"shard-marks: a legacy plain-keyed row with a ref reads as a total loss (empty shard name, now 0)"},"id":"eb360ee4b758c60b557a9f6db","kind":"bug.found","lamport":57854,"schema":1,"subject":"B21968d4ea4","ts":"2026-10-11T22:12:09.321532Z"}
{"agent":"U13","data":{"body":"Fixes bug B21968d4ea4: doctor exits 1 and brief shows a false 'Lost events' block: shardmarks._rows_here selects every mark row whose ref equals the current branch regardless of key, and lost() takes the shard name from row['shard']. Four rows written by the intermediate build (plain shard-name key, ref field, NO shard field) therefore get name '' (not on disk, scanned as 0 events) and report 'lost N event(s) (was N, now 0)' with an empty shard name. Not a git-vs-working-tree issue: lost() scans the working tree. accept cannot clear them either (it pops the key for shard ''). Fix: migrate legacy plain keys to scoped rows on read (max count, never lowering), derive shard/ref from the key, replace torn shapes; uncommitted appends are never a loss.\n\nWrite the regression test first and watch it FAIL on the unfixed code; then `ddflow complete fix-B21968d4ea4 --regression-test <test>` closes the bug with the task (or `ddflow bug fixed B21968d4ea4 --regression-test <test>` first).","fixes":["B21968d4ea4"],"globs":["ddflow/services/shardmarks.py","tests/test_shard_high_water.py"],"line":"","needs":[],"parent":"","priority":100,"tags":["bugfix"],"title":"Fix bug B21968d4ea4: shard-marks: a legacy plain-keyed row with a ref reads as a total loss (empty shard name, now 0)"},"id":"e4819e80f824fea0973034cf5","kind":"task.added","lamport":57855,"schema":1,"subject":"fix-B21968d4ea4","ts":"2026-10-11T22:12:09.445404Z"}
